  "section_notes": "S1 is strict on reporting deadlines and scope. S2 has a 55°C test and 5% action threshold but no automatic sales stop above 5%, so it is weakened. S3 requires new-unit shut-off and a 6-year retrofit, acceptable. S4 requires built-in suppression within 36 months, acceptable. S5 sets an 8/100k review trigger but makes recall conditional on a regulator finding, so it is weakened."
